# board_city.pdl - the RTA board slice in the Battery feature format (rta_city_op paints it; D113). 32 x 14 cells of 10 m.
# A harbour inlet crosses the main street; the KIND row lets the bridge deck span the water, so the car can cross. The ground is one park polygon (grass that reaches the border would flood to harbour).
# The painter ends a feature at a gap (polygon edge over 250 m, line step over 80 m), so every edge here is shorter than that.
